  <h1>Enshrouded 1.0 New Spells: All 9 Spells, Summons and Eternal Versions</h1>

  <p class="muted">
    Enshrouded 1.0 brings <strong>9 new spells</strong> to the game, including the first-ever
    <strong>summons</strong> category, along with <strong>22 tier-7 Eternal spell versions</strong> that
    no longer consume spell ammo and can be upgraded like weapons. Wands also get a new piercing heavy
    attack. This page lists every spell and magic change Keen Games has confirmed for the full release
    on October 15, 2026.
  </p>

  <div class="toc">
    <strong>On this page</strong>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#quick-answer">Quick answer</a></li>
      <li><a href="#new-spells">The 9 new spells</a></li>
